          <p>AI data centres and GPU clusters are the primary driver of G.657.A2 demand growth in 2026. High-density rack configurations make bend-insensitive fiber the only viable specification for intra-rack and cross-connect patching — G.652.D's 30 mm bend radius cannot be maintained in practice at this density.</p>
        </div>
